  "details": "It would be nice to have exposure occlusion or something similar in standard lite which would mask the intensity of specular highlights / reflections with the darkness of the lightmap. \n\nThis effect can be found in shaders such as Silent's Filamented shader and Mochie's standard shader and helps make reflections look much better. \n\nIf it can be done in such a way to not have a significant performance impact, I believe it would be a really good addition and would mean I could use the shader in my worlds with there only being slight differences between it and the shader I currently use (Filamented)!",
